"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Attack hurls the Knight into or out of combat and can be upgraded to set enemies ablaze! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify Armor makes the Knight an impenetrable tank and can additionally cleanse the hero from all negative status effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearsome War Chant terrifies surrounding enemies and sends them fleeing! Upgrade to embolden the Knight with a temporary increase in attack speed and damage. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.poster.avif?t=1769882070\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.webm?t=1769882070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.mp4?t=1769882070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ranger</strong> is a shadowy archer, reliant on stealth and distance from foes. Utilize a variety of bows and arrow types to exploit your enemy\u2019s weaknesses. Fast movement and careful planning will keep this hero alive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scatter a blanket of caltrops behind in the Ranger\u2019s footsteps to slow down and damage pursuing enemies. Upgrade quantity and quality to lacerate foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate fire rate and watch the enemy fall in droves! Upgrade to unleash a volley of arrows at inhuman speeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the Ranger into an agent of shadow by throwing down obscuring smoke clouds. Further upgrade this ability to unleash a massive poisonous plume!<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.poster.avif?t=1769882070\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.webm?t=1769882070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.mp4?t=1769882070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Beastmaster</strong> brings his friends from the forest. Summon allies and avoid direct combat while tactically turning the tide of battle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With many summons active, the Beastmaster gives a rallying cry, gathering all friends in one place and bolstering them with immunities and enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a quick escape by burrowing beneath the enemy\u2019s feet. Upgrade to further embolden the Beastmaster\u2019s allies, or to increase personal strength and strike from below!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy bear traps, stopping enemies in their paths and creating the perfect opportunity for your animal companions to strike! Upgrade and permanently cripple foe\u2019s movement.<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further enhance your heroes by implementing small stat increases or temporarily boost with a variety of potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dungeons and mine mysterious geodes to uncover many artifacts of power. Each artifact contributes a unique effect and can be merged with others to create bizarre and powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept quests from your townsfolk, then go out adventuring to garner greater fame and other rewards.</p>","developers":["MACHINE GUN CHICKEN STUDIOS LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/header.jpg?t=1769882070","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872910/864345/5cce8b6a5c9ac77d5fb4b99e9bd077f391b64010/1750949475/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743885986","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872910/864345/5cce8b6a5c9ac77d5fb4b99e9bd077f391b64010/1750949475/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743885986","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872910/864345/5cce8b6a5c9ac77d5fb4b99e9bd077f391b64010/1750949475/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743885986","id":257122579,"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122579/774cf8e15a3b59060855a99f9945501c186b8cc0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743885986"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872910/688968/21e492831f0b093b7717737689b04422a6783444/1750949475/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743885988","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872910/688968/21e492831f0b093b7717737689b04422a6783444/1750949475/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743885988","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872910/688968/21e492831f0b093b7717737689b04422a6783444/1750949475/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743885988","id":257016820,"name":"Character Intro Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257016820/a7b5012625ceaa47ed99f56e483d9356dc818833/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743885988"}],"name":"In Search of Heroes!","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_fre