rious randomly-generated locales, complete quests and take down fearsome bosses. Return to your home estate to construct new buildings, equip powerful weapons, and rally new heroes!","steam_appid":2872910,"support_info":{"email":"support@mgc-studios.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}